Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The encoder and decoder are original implementations written from ISO/IEC
13818-7 (MPEG-2 AAC) and ISO/IEC 14496-3 (MPEG-4 Audio) and published
literature. They are not translations of, and do not derive from, any other
AAC encoder's or decoder's source. The normative tables (the Huffman
codebooks, the scalefactor band tables, TNS_MAX_BANDS) are reproduced from
ISO/IEC 13818-7:2004; the SBR and parametric stereo tables (the Huffman
tables, the QMF window, the noise table, the hybrid filter prototypes and
band maps) from ISO/IEC 14496-3:2009. docs/PROVENANCE.md records the copies
they were transcribed from.

The decoder (AAC-LC, HE-AAC, HE-AAC v2) is verified against the conformance
streams and reference waveforms of ISO/IEC 14496-26, which are not part of
this repository: tools/fetch_conformance.py downloads them from ISO, under
ISO's terms for its electronic inserts. It is also compared with faad2's
decoder, used only as a black box (a command-line tool whose PCM is
compared); none of its code is included or was consulted. The test streams
in tests/data were made by the Fraunhofer FDK AAC encoder library, driven
through its public API (tools/make_test_streams.py); they are encoder output
only, and none of that library's code is included or was consulted.

