Patents
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AAC, HE-AAC and HE-AAC v2 may be subject to patent licensing in some
jurisdictions; Via LA administers licensing programmes for AAC and HE-AAC.
This licence grants no rights under any patent, and the authors make no
claim about whether a licence is needed for any use. Spectral band
replication and parametric stereo (HE-AAC, HE-AAC v2) are implemented; USAC
(xHE-AAC) is not.

